OL,3,AUp to 50 Scottish police officers
OL,4,Asuspended over alleged crimes against
OL,5,Awomen
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe chief constable of Police Scotland
OL,8,Fhas said up to 50 serving officers are
OL,9,Fcurrently suspended over allegations of
OL,10,Fviolence against women and girls.
OL,12,FJo Farrell said she expected more would
OL,13,Fface sanctions over their behaviour
OL,14,Ffollowing a spate of former officers
OL,15,Fbeing convicted for sexual offences.
OL,17,FFarrell said a review into the handling
OL,18,Fof the case of police officer Alan
OL,19,FGreer ` who was exposed as a serial
OL,20,Frapist after taking his own life ` was
OL,21,Funder way.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
